### d:\code\VisualStudioCode\go\gobench>go run ./cmd/server/main.go

### 1. 系统健康检查 (无需权限)
GET http://localhost:8080/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. 用户注册
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "gnk48lb",
    "password": "8964"
}

###

### 3. 用户登录 (登录成功后复制返回的 token)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "gnk48lb",
    "password": "8964"
}

### 下面是需要认证的接口测试
### 注意：请将下面的 <YOUR_TOKEN> 替换为上面登录接口返回的实际 token 字符串

@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 4. 创建任务 1 (HTTP 类型)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "抖音用户收益计算",
    "task_type": "function",
    "cron_expr": "0 0 * * *",
    "payload": "{\"batch_size\": 1000, \"simulate_count\": 1000000}",
    "retry_count": 3,
    "timeout": 120
}

###

### 5. 创建任务 2 (Shell 类型)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "清理过期视频缓存",
    "task_type": "shell",
    "cron_expr": "0 2 * * *",
    "payload": "{\"command\": \"echo 'Cleaning expired video cache...'\"}",
    "retry_count": 1,
    "timeout": 60
}

###

### 6. 获取任务列表 (带分页测试)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 7. 获取单个任务详情 (请根据列表返回的 ID 修改末尾的数字，比如 /1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. 更新任务状态
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "抖音用户收益计算-已暂停",
    "task_type": "function",
    "cron_expr": "0 0 * * *",
    "payload": "{\"batch_size\": 1000}",
    "retry_count": 5,
    "timeout": 120,
    "status": "paused"
}

###

### 9. 删除任务 (测试完可以试着删除，同样注意修改 ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}